# Hermes Cortex — Blocked IPs
# Add bare IPs (one per line, no deny keyword, no semicolon).
# The deploy script appends these to the nginx geo block.
#
# These are known storage scanners — they probe /storage/ endpoints
# and attempt archive file enumeration.


